      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oppenheimer_(film)",
      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"fe1ce209e72f14eb\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nIt won a leading five Golden Globe Awards, receiving <strong>Best Motion Picture – Drama</strong>, Best Director for Nolan, Best Actor in a Motion Picture – Drama for Murphy, Best Supporting Actor – Motion Picture for Downey Jr., and Best Original Score for Göransson at the 81st ceremony.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"fe1ce209e72f14eb\">>>",
